# Local datasets the notebook exports were rendered from, with their SHA-256.
#
# The files are not committed. This list is, so a render and CI compute the same export
# fingerprint (docs/extract_all.jl), and a render refuses a dataset that changed since it was
# declared: after an intended change to a dataset, update its line here and re-render.
#
# Paths are relative to docs/notebooks/data/, except that `xcat/…` resolves under
# BASISSIM_XCAT_DIR when that is set. The lab's copy is the XCAT male chest export semmd-bayesian
# uses on CRSP: BASISSIM_XCAT_DIR="/share/crsp/lab/symolloi/share/XCAT Anatomies/vmale_50/vmale_50_chest_with_plaque".
#
# Notebook 05 reads:
afa841c45eadfb57a45e3eb0a5a43771d0e881a7d79a4be060973098477f8571  xcat/vmale_50_raw_1600x1400x867_8bit_little_endian_act_1.raw
a5dd37ef16acb73103b95bd75e0ca06d0451dc17c66fcea81a2a950e1ab8e5b2  xcat/Material_Spreadsheets/vmale_50_materials_heart_high_contrast.xlsx
